[478,0,0,1890,"Raja Lala Deen Dayal","Raja Lala Deen Dayal was one of India's most famous photographers, appointed to photograph the Nizam of Hyderabad. This portrait shows him in a white turban, calm and confident.","What would a photographer need to carry around India in the 1880s?"],
